on-arrival: in_hamburg_left = 0; in_hamburg_tolerated_spd = 0; in_hamburg_spd = 0; in_hamburg_tolerated_soclib: 0; in_hamburg_soclib: 0; in_hamburg_socchr: 0; in_hamburg_tolerated_weimar: 1; in_hamburg_weimar: 0; in_hamburg_groko = 0; in_hamburg_bourgeois: 0; in_hamburg_right: 0; in_hamburg_nsdap = 0; workers_spd += 1*(1-dissent)

The SPD enters a Weimar Coalition with the DDP and Zentrum, with USPD toleration. [? if h_uspd_tolerated_weimar_coalition < 50 : This is despite it lacking a majority. ?]

@h_weimar_coalition
title: A Weimar coalition.
subtitle: SPD + Z + [+ ddp_name +] ([+ h_weimar_coalition +]%)
view-if: h_weimar_coalition >= 50 or (in_hamburg_weimar and not nsdap_hl >= 50) or (in_hamburg_tolerated_weimar and not nsdap_hl >= 50) 
choose-if: h_weimar_coalition >= 50 or (in_hamburg_weimar and not nsdap_hl >= 50)
on-arrival: in_hamburg_left = 0; in_hamburg_tolerated_spd = 0; in_hamburg_spd = 0; in_hamburg_tolerated_soclib: 0; in_hamburg_soclib: 0; in_hamburg_socchr: 0; in_hamburg_tolerated_weimar: 0; in_hamburg_weimar: 1; in_hamburg_groko = 0; in_hamburg_bourgeois: 0; in_hamburg_right: 0; in_hamburg_nsdap = 0; workers_spd += 1*(1-dissent)

The SPD enters a Weimar Coalition with the DDP and Zentrum. [? if h_weimar_coalition < 50 : This is despite it lacking a majority. ?]

@nsdap_majority
title: The NSDAP has won a majority.
view-if: nsdap_hl >= 50 or in_nazi_hamburg
on-arrival: in_hamburg_left = 0; in_hamburg_tolerated_spd = 0; in_hamburg_spd = 0; in_hamburg_tolerated_soclib: 0; in_hamburg_soclib: 0; in_hamburg_socchr: 0; in_hamburg_tolerated_weimar: 0; in_hamburg_weimar: 0; in_hamburg_groko = 0; in_hamburg_bourgeois: 0; in_hamburg_right: 0; in_hamburg_nsdap = 1; workers_spd += 1*(1-dissent); hamburg_nsdap += 0.25; hamburg_uspd -= 0.25; hamburg_spd -= 0.1; workers_nsdap += 3; new_middle_nsdap += 3; old_middle_nsdap += 4; rural_nsdap += 3; unemployed_nsdap += 3

The NSDAP governs Hamburg alone. Suppression of the left-wing parties is intense, and the Nazis consolidate power within the state.

@no_majority
view-if: not (nsdap_hl >= 50 or in_nazi_hamburg) and not (spd_hl >= 50 or in_spd_hamburg) and not ((h_left_coalition >= 50 or in_hamburg_left) or (reformist_strength < 25 and uspd_relation >= 55 and communist_coalition >= 2)) and not (h_social_liberal_coalition >= 50 or in_hamburg_soclib) and not (h_grand_coalition >= 50 or h_elections < 1 or in_hamburg_groko)
title: There is no clear majority.
on-arrival: uspd_relation += 5 if h_left_coalition >= 50 and uspd_relation < 50; hamburg_uspd -= 0.2 if h_left_coalition >= 50 and uspd_relation < 50; hamburg_spd += 0.2 if h_left_coalition >= 50 and uspd_relation < 50; hamburg_dvp -= 0.1; hamburg_other -= 0.1; hamburg_dnvp -= 0.1; hamburg_ddp += 0.1; hamburg_nsdap += 0.05; hamburg_election_month = month+3; hamburg_election_year += 1 if hamburg_election_month > 12; hamburg_election_month -= 12 if hamburg_election_month > 12

There is no clear majority, new elections have been set.
